# The `f1aV1p` reduction of set (e)

The label-split certificate of `QED.Algebra.IBPCertSector` reduces the projected combination `Y - (d
- 1)² T₁` of the lower-loop piece `f1a_V1` (topology `f1a`, 1 mass-counterterm insertions)
